AeroMate (PS-01) — Product Requirements Document
Version 1.0 · Hackathon MVP · Responsive Web Application
1. Product overview
Product name: AeroMate
Product concept: An AI-powered aviation journey companion that helps travelers search for flights, track flight status, view live aircraft positions, and receive personalized travel guidance when disruptions occur.
Platform: Responsive web application.
Primary objective: Provide flight information and useful travel assistance in one place through a simple interface and an AI assistant.
2. Problem statement
Travelers often need multiple applications to search for flights, check flight status, track aircraft, and understand what to do when a flight is delayed or cancelled. This creates confusion, especially when travel plans change unexpectedly.
AeroMate aims to simplify this experience by combining flight information, interactive tracking, and multilingual AI assistance in one application.
3. Product goals
Enable users to search for available flights.
Display flight status and scheduled or estimated times when available.
Show aircraft positions on an interactive map when live-position data is available.
Provide AI-generated explanations and practical disruption guidance.
Support multilingual conversations.
Allow users to save and revisit trips.
Deliver a responsive, reliable, and accessible experience.
4. Target users
Regular travelers: Want to check flight details quickly.
Frequent flyers: Need convenient access to upcoming trips.
Disrupted travelers: Want guidance when a flight is delayed or cancelled.
International travelers: Prefer travel assistance in their chosen language.
