9. System architecture
React + Vite frontend
Dashboard · Search · Map · Chat
Node.js + Express backend
Validation · REST APIs · Provider integration
Supabase
PostgreSQL, Auth, Storage
Flight APIs
Search, status, live positions
OpenAI API
Context-aware, multilingual travel assistance
Mapbox renders the interactive map in the frontend. Vercel hosts the frontend, Render hosts the Express backend, and Supabase manages the database and authentication.
Important: Flight search, flight status, and live aircraft positions may require separate API products or providers. Verify access, coverage, rate limits, and available data before promising a feature as live.
